    <briefdescription>
<para>Global epoch counter for memory reclamation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each thread announces the epoch it&apos;s in; memory is reclaimed when all threads have advanced past a given epoch. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
